      "description": "A divider-led summary for secondary methods or history.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-details\"><summary class=\"ds-summary\">Forecast method <span class=\"ds-disclosure-meta\">Supporting evidence</span></summary><p class=\"ds-details-copy\">Full method and source detail belong here; decisive facts stay in the working view.</p></details>",
      "css": ".ds-details { border-top:1px solid var(--line, #d5ddda); background:transparent; color:var(--text, #283138); font-family:'Segoe UI Variable Text', 'Segoe UI', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; } .ds-summary { position:relative; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:6px 12px; min-height:44px; padding:10px 4px 10px 24px; font-size:.875rem; font-weight:600; line-height:1.4; list-style:none; cursor:pointer; } .ds-summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; } .ds-summary::before { content:\"\"; position:absolute; left:4px; top:50%; width:7px; height:7px; border-bottom:1.5px solid currentColor; border-right:1.5px solid currentColor; transform:translateY(-50%) rotate(-45deg); } .ds-details[open] .ds-summary::before { transform:translateY(-65%) rotate(45deg); } .ds-summary:hover { color:var(--accent, #885731); } .ds-summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent-2, #1b7567); outline-offset: 3px; } .ds-disclosure-meta { color:var(--muted, #59656b); font-size:.75rem; font-weight:400; } .ds-details-copy { margin:8px 0 12px; font-size:.8125rem; line-height:1.5; }"
    }
